# Question 3

The users of my application will be persons who wants to share their favorite things and creating the lists of them.
There will be only one role for users, which is a regular user. They will be able to create, read, update and delete
their own lists and items. They will also be able to share their lists with other users, but they will not be able to
edit or delete other users' lists or items.
There would be admin users who will be able to manage the application, including creating, reading, updating and deleting
all lists and items, as well as managing users. They will also be able to manage the application settings and configurations.

